    "detailed_description": "You can  support me as a solo developer by wishlisting my game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.poster.avif?t=1719773961\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.webm?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.mp4?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br>EXTERMINATOR is a fast-paced, Third Person Shooter with a lot of challenges from hard bosses to defeat to puzzles and more, with a talent tree window to customize your robot abilities toward what equipment or playstyle you like, in a mission based game each with unique challenges &amp; rewards.  developed in 2 years by me as its sole developer .<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/5d8e05ada963b04e5c949ee90f673da2.poster.avif?t=1719773961\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/5d8e05ada963b04e5c949ee90f673da2.webm?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/5d8e05ada963b04e5c949ee90f673da2.mp4?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>DESTROY DOZEN OF ROBOTS</strong><br>Destroy hostile robots in dozens ,you need to use every armament you have to destroy them , each have unique abilities, all of them are dangerous you can die in matter of second if they get to you or you are not familiar know that enemy abilities how work to dodge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/ec7c6e3f50bc719689fd83182735f51d.poster.avif?t=1719773961\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/ec7c6e3f50bc719689fd83182735f51d.webm?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/ec7c6e3f50bc719689fd83182735f51d.mp4?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>DEFEAT BOSSES BY MASTERING THEM</strong><br>Defeat Hard Challenging Bosses to get their armaments. bosses have multi phases each phase make boss stronger, abilities  speed and damage changes, also <br>boss get new abilties to make it even harder.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/cef31c61d5b40db9907e57a9947438e7.poster.avif?t=1719773961\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/cef31c61d5b40db9907e57a9947438e7.webm?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/cef31c61d5b40db9907e57a9947438e7.mp4?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>ITS NOT ONLY A SHOOTER GAME</strong><br>each mission filled with trap rooms, puzzles, unique encounters to overcome between hard and long fights you pass to challenge how much of gamer you are..",
    "about_the_game": "You can  support me as a solo developer by wishlisting my game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.poster.avif?t=1719773961\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.webm?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.mp4?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br>EXTERMINATOR is a fast-paced, Third Person Shooter with a lot of challenges from hard bosses to defeat to puzzles and more, with a talent tree window to customize your robot abilities toward what equipment or playstyle you like, in a mission based game each with unique challenges &amp; rewards.  developed in 2 years by me as its sole developer .<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/5d8e05ada963b04e5c949ee90f673da2.poster.avif?t=1719773961\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/5d8e05ada963b04e5c949ee90f673da2.webm?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747640/extras/5d8e05ada963b04e5c949ee90f673da2.mp4?t=1719773961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>DESTROY DOZEN OF ROBOTS</strong><br>Destroy hostile robots in dozens ,you need to use every armament you have to destroy them , each have unique abilities, all of them are dangerous you can die in matter of second if they get to you or you are not familiar know that enemy abilities how